# 從頭再嚟
(pos:副詞)
<explanation>
yue:重新開始，唔接續之前嘅做法，全部由頭開始再做一次
eng:start over again / start from scratch
<eg>
yue:你講得唔明，我睇唔明，我哋就從頭再嚟講啦。 (nei5 gong2 dak1 m4 ming4, ngo5 tai2 m4 ming4, ngo5 dei6 zau6 cong2 tau4 zoi3 lai4 gong2 laa1.)
eng:You're not making sense and I don't understand, so let's start over and talk again.

yue:呢次唔好似咁，我哋從頭再嚟計劃啦。 (ni1 ci3 m4 hou2 zoi3 gam2, ngo5 dei6 cong2 tau4 zoi3 lai4 gai3 cyun4 laa1.)
eng:This time it shouldn't be like that, let's start over and plan again. [end of text]


